@startuml
title RuleSphere - Package Diagram\nSubsystem Structuring & Class Ownership (F-19, AC-01)
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle folder
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #496477
skinparam packageBorderColor #496477
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 50
hide empty members

package "Control Plane (Decision Management Subsystem)" as Control #EDF5FF {
  package "Administration" as Admin #DCEBFA {
    class Tenant
    class Workspace
    class User
    class SharedLibraryVersion
  }
  package "Decision Modeling" as Modeling #DCEBFA {
    class Decision
    class DecisionVersion
    class DecisionGraph
    class DecisionValidator
  }
  package "Governance and Approval" as Governance #DCEBFA {
    class Release
    class GovernancePolicy
    class ApprovalEvidence
    class ArtifactBuilder
  }
  package "Evidence Queries" as Queries #DCEBFA {
    class EvidenceQueryService
  }
}

package "Delivery Plane (Distribution Subsystem)" as Delivery #F0ECFF {
  package "Deployment Management" as Deployment #E6DFFA {
    class Deployment
    class DesiredActiveState
  }
  package "Artifact Distribution" as Distribution #E6DFFA {
    class DistributionService
    class DesiredStatePublisher
  }
}

package "Data Plane (Stateless Execution Subsystem)" as Data #E9F8ED {
  package "Runtime API and Execution" as Runtime #D6F0DF {
    class RuntimeAdapter
    class EvaluationService
    class GraphExecutor
  }
  package "Local Artifact Management" as Local #D6F0DF {
    class LocalArtifactStore
    class SnapshotResolver
    class AtomicSnapshot
  }
}

package "Shared Modules" as Shared #FFF6DF {
  package "Security and Scope" as Security #FFF0C2 {
    class AuthorizationService
  }
  package "Versioned Contracts" as Contracts #FFF0C2 {
    class SchemaVersion
    class SchemaField
  }
  package "Audit and Observability" as Audit #FFF0C2 {
    class ExecutionTraceTree
    class ComplianceRecord
    class FleetConvergenceView
  }
}

' Inter-package Subsystem Dependencies
Modeling ..> Admin : library pins
Governance ..> Modeling : validated revision
Deployment ..> Governance : approved artifact
Deployment ..> Distribution : publish desired state
Runtime ..> Local : local snapshot
Queries ..> Audit : trace & compliance records

Control ..> Security : management auth
Delivery ..> Security : release auth
Data ..> Security : runtime token auth

Control ..> Contracts : validate & version
Delivery ..> Contracts : publish schema
Data ..> Contracts : evaluate against schema

Control ..> Audit : admin audit logs
Delivery ..> Audit : release audit logs
Data ..> Audit : async trace persistence

note right of Data
  **Subsystem Invariant (AC-04):**
  Data Plane does NOT depend synchronously on Control Plane.
  Resolves all executions via Local Artifact Management.
end note

legend bottom
  F-19 Subsystem Structuring: Maps domain classes to logical packages across the 3 AC-01 planes.
  Dashed arrows (..>) denote compile-time/logical package dependencies.
endlegend
@enduml
